# Line endings: LF everywhere, on every OS (owner's call 2026-10-04 — the PC
# checkout had 698 files that differed only by CRLF, which made every git
# status on Windows vs the Cowork VM disagree). Overrides core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.duckdb binary
